 </span><span begin="00:56.550" end="00:56.880">I </span><span begin="00:56.880" end="00:57.270">have </span><span begin="00:57.270" end="00:57.540">is </span><span begin="00:57.540" end="00:58.530">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.650" end="01:01.260"><span begin="00:58.650" end="00:58.950">Our </span><span begin="00:58.950" end="00:59.400">loves </span><span begin="00:59.400" end="00:59.670">the </span><span begin="00:59.670" end="01:00.390">perfect </span><span begin="01:00.390" end="01:01.260">crime</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.260" end="01:03.810"><span begin="01:01.260" end="01:01.410">I </span><span begin="01:01.410" end="01:01.860">wanna </span><span begin="01:01.860" end="01:01.890">I </span><span begin="01:01.890" end="01:02.370">wanna </span><span begin="01:02.370" end="01:02.400">I </span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.820">wanna </span><span begin="01:02.820" end="01:03.240">touch </span><span begin="01:03.240" end="01:03.810">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.990" end="01:06.030"><span begin="01:03.990" end="01:04.320">You </span><span begin="01:04.320" end="01:04.590">wanna </span><span begin="01:04.590" end="01:05.040">touch </span><span begin="01:05.040" end="01:05.310">me </span><span begin="01:05.310" end="01:06.030">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.300" end="01:10.140"><span begin="01:06.300" end="01:06.750">Every </span><span begin="01:06.750" end="01:07.440">way </span><span begin="01:07.440" end="01:07.710">and </span><span begin="01:07.710" end="01:08.100">when </span><span begin="01:08.100" end="01:08.370">they </span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:08.850">set </span><span begin="01:08.850" end="01:09.120">me </span><span begin="01:09.120" end="01:10.140">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.170" end="01:12.780"><span begin="01:10.170" end="01:10.680">Just </span><span begin="01:10.680" end="01:10.980">put </span><span begin="01:10.980" end="01:11.400">your </span><span begin="01: